{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202170","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202170","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1120217001:1":{"text":"Alsa... Pops was the only father I ever had. The Grimmaw is not my clan.","source_cn":"阿尔萨……我的父亲只有老爹一个人，黑嚎也并非我的氏族。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x016A3D0F048EEF56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120217002:1":{"text":"I am Soren of the Uru Clan. Always was, and always will be.","source_cn":"我是乌尔氏族的索恩。过去是，现在是，以后也是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E933D7DB1C7E22C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120217003:1":{"text":"Clever words. I was gonna give you a piece of my mind for not telling me.","source_cn":"好狡猾，我本来还要怪你不告诉我这件事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD3A54DF98E8A7A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120217004:1":{"text":"But seeing your sorry state, I'll forgive you instead.","source_cn":"但，看你现在这么可怜，我原谅你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55376D14D510F6F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120217005:1":{"text":"I'm sorry, Alsa. I didn't think it was important, and... Well, it's tough to talk about.","source_cn":"抱歉，阿尔萨，这件事我觉得不重要……也很难开口讲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12E7ADCEA6ACD73A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120217006:1":{"text":"It's alright. It happened before you joined us, so I can see why you wouldn't want to talk about it.","source_cn":"没关系啦。这都是你加入乌尔氏族之前的事了，不想说也正常。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE29D1B9480468F8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120217007:1":{"text":"But there is one thing I want to know.","source_cn":"不过，我也有在意的东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F054AE2C4AAE1C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120217008:1":{"text":"Soren, when we fought Orson at the Warsong Festival, you—","source_cn":"索恩，我们之前在战歌节上联手打败奥格的时候，你——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD6D2A381141249D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120217009:1":{"text":"At the time, I didn't think anything of it.","source_cn":"那个时候，我什么都没想。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12C307B4E9149A63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120217010:1":{"text":"The situation was critical. I could think only of the fight.","source_cn":"当时情况危急。除了战斗之外，我根本没有余裕思考任何东西了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55343CDD6DDC694D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120217011:1":{"text":"And anyway, defeating Orson was the right thing to do. I couldn't do anything to change that.","source_cn":"更何况……打败奥格是正确的的事。这一点不会改变。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49837C00ED7243BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120217012:1":{"text":"About Orson's funeral, I'm not going. You guys go ahead, don't worry about me.","source_cn":"奥格的葬礼，我不想参加了……你们去吧，不用管我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB57C9303EE735D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120217013:1":{"text":"... I won't try to make that decision for you, but Soren, I just hope you won't have any regrets.","source_cn":"……我不想劝你如何决定，但索恩，我希望你不要留有遗憾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x540826E1417D0E81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120217014:1":{"text":"I'm sure your feelings are all mixed up inside right now. Just take your time to think things out.","source_cn":"我知道你现在内心一定也很复杂。不过没关系，有些事情慢慢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9ADAB4A54069818C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120217015:1":{"text":"And I'll be there for you—along with the entire Uru family.","source_cn":"我会陪着你的。还有乌尔的大家也会一直你身边。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9BC463E7DB93320","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120217016:1":{"text":"You'll never be alone like you were as a child in the desert. You've got us.","source_cn":"你永远不会再变成那个沙漠中孤立无援的婴儿，你还有我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28A3BEC053C17285","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120217017:1":{"text":"... Thanks, Alsa.","source_cn":"……谢谢你，阿尔萨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x383DA82B51474866","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120217018:1":{"text":"It seems that, with help from his companion, the young man has gotten back on his feet.","source_cn":"看来，有一位年轻人已经在同伴的帮助下舔舐好自己的伤口了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5995F651EAFA4182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1120217018":{"text":"It seems that, with help from his companion, the young man has gotten back on his feet.","source_cn":"看来，有一位年轻人已经在同伴的帮助下舔舐好自己的伤口了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5995F651EAFA4182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1120217019:1":{"text":"Alright, we can all go back to the Uru Clan together!","source_cn":"嗯，我们马上回去——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88687148C6E9E59A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1120217020:1":{"text":"If we're leaving, let's leave with our heads held high!","source_cn":"就算是离开这里，也会堂堂正正地走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F125315A5B2BD56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1120217021:1":{"text":"Alsa, you...","source_cn":"阿尔萨……你……我明白了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x344D2B287EB5E381","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:0:1":{"text":"Soren will be okay, right?","source_cn":"索恩没事吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF3E7A25BE79B7F52","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Soren will be okay, right?","female":"Soren will be okay, right?","variant_male_record_index":"62954","variant_female_record_index":"62955","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:1:2":{"text":"What are we doing, Alsa?","source_cn":"阿尔萨，怎么样了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8A41A423389C17F2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What are we doing, Alsa?","female":"What are we doing, Alsa?","variant_male_record_index":"62956","variant_female_record_index":"62957","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索恩":{"text":"Soren","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"Alsa","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布鲁特斯":{"text":"Brutus","source":"布鲁特斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":3}}